# Copy to `.env` (docker-compose reads it automatically) or export these as real
# environment variables before running the API directly. ASP.NET Core binds
# double-underscore names to nested configuration sections, so `Ai__AnthropicApiKey`
# maps to `Ai:AnthropicApiKey` (see src/LexFlow.Api/appsettings.json /
# LexFlow.Infrastructure/Ai/AiOptions.cs). For a plain `dotnet run` dev setup you can
# instead copy src/LexFlow.Api/appsettings.Development.json.example to
# appsettings.Development.json and set the same key there.

# Module 16 AI Gateway (Anthropic Claude). Required for the AI Assistant / chat,
# draft, research, summarize, etc. endpoints under /api/v1/ai/*. Leave unset in an
# environment where AI features aren't needed — the API responds with a clear
# 422 AI_NOT_CONFIGURED error instead of failing unpredictably.
Ai__AnthropicApiKey=
